5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,Hello everyone. It is such a pleasure to be working with you all on this. I believe a thoughtful arrangement will help us all feel more connected and happy in our shared space. What do you all think?,"{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"Let's keep a level head. Before we get carried away with ideas of happiness, we should examine the data to ensure the new layout is actually sustainable and efficient for everyone.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I agree with Toshio. It's probably best to be careful and look at the facts first. I don't want us to make a mistake that causes problems later.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Mio,,"I'm so excited to get started! I agree that we need a plan, but let's make sure it's one that actually makes our daily lives easier and more fun! What should we check first?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Efficiency and happiness are fine goals, but let's not forget the physical reality of the space. A plan that looks good on paper is useless if it's physically draining. We need actual data on the environment.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"I agree with you all. To ensure we create a space where everyone feels welcome and included, I would like to look into ""Two project strands within earshot last spring"" and ""What this year's two joiners reported.""","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"I will look into the ""Basis of the department's floor billing"" and the ""Facilities quote for re-running power and network."" We must understand the financial and technical constraints before we consider any specific layout.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I think I'll look into the ""Basis of the department's floor billing"" and the ""Facilities quote for re-running power and network"" too. I just want to be sure we aren't overspending or causing any budget issues.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Mio,,"I want to know how we actually start our days! I'll check the ""Morning routine on the pilot floor upstairs"" and the ""Arrival times in the badge records"" to see how it all works!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"I'll take the ""Sound meter readings across the room"" and the ""Physio's note from the workstation check."" If we're being thorough, we should prioritize the actual physical impact of the environment over mere guesswork.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"It seems we have a wonderful variety of perspectives. By looking into these different areas, we can ensure that both the practical needs and the hearts of our team are well cared for.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"It is a comprehensive spread. By dividing the research this way, we cover the financial, physical, and social aspects of the office. Let's wait for the results before drawing any conclusions.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I hope the information is helpful. I'm a bit worried about the costs, so I'll be waiting to see what the data says. I'll do my best to help everyone.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Mio,,"I'm with you, Toshio! Let's see what we find. I'm really curious if the way we arrive and set up makes a big difference in our mornings. I bet there are some cool tricks we can learn!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"Let's hope your ""cool tricks"" and ""hearts of the team"" actually lead to a functional office. I'll be interested to see if the physical data reveals the discomfort I suspect. See you all in the next round.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I agree. Let us all take a moment to look into these things carefully. I hope the information we find helps us create a warm and inclusive atmosphere for everyone. See you all soon.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I agree. Let's proceed with the research and reconvene once the data is available. I'll be interested to see if the costs align with our current budget.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
22,1,4,pass,Toshio,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
23,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I'll... I'll go look into those things now. I hope we can find a solution that works for everyone without being too stressful. See you all soon.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Mio,,"I'm ready! I'll go hunt for those clues right now! I can't wait to see how everyone's morning starts and if we can make ours even better! See you all soon, bye-bye!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
25,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,"I'll be waiting. Let's see if the data actually reveals anything useful, or if we're just rearranging the deck chairs. I'm curious to see if anyone else values actual comfort over mere ""harmony.""","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
